# Runtime notices

Headset Desk code and the imported Sony Device Center protocol/transport are MIT licensed.
Qt 6.8.3 is dynamically linked, unmodified, under LGPL version 3, with its additional
third-party notices preserved in Qt-6.8.3/. GPL version 3 and LGPL version 3 texts are included.
Replacing compatible Qt DLLs and QML plugins is permitted; reverse engineering for debugging
such replacements is permitted. Do not distribute a single EXE without its runtime files.

The exact corresponding Qt source archives, their upstream URLs and SHA-256 hashes are
recorded in Qt-source-manifest.json. The companion GitHub release asset
headset-desk-v@VERSION@-qt-runtime-sources.zip contains these complete source archives.
Provide that source archive alongside the app if redistributing this application.
The separate Headset Desk source ZIP contains the application code, QML and CMake build files.
To relink/rebuild, use Qt 6.8.3, MinGW GCC 13.1.0 and the build instructions in docs/desktop-build.md.

GCC runtime libraries use GPL version 3 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception.
The MinGW-w64 and winpthreads notices supplied with Qt's MinGW 13.1.0 toolchain are preserved.
No Sony artwork is included. The original headset icon is drawn by Headset Desk.

